      "raw": "<p>I think that all of them have awesome new looks. I especially like AZ&#39;s costume change, it adds in some much needed color but you can still tell it&#39;s him. I&#39;m getting a &#39;Knight in Shining Armor&#39; vibe from Bunker, especially with the golden highlights. Interesting how Tachyon is going more blue/white than red/white in her costume, guess she&#39;s going more for team colors. Wraith is adding more color into her suit as well, hopefully she can still bend in to the shadows. Though I guess if she was able to blend with the white bandages and all that, this won&#39;t have any problem. Legacy is keeping his classic look which is a good idea. And last but not least Unity has left behind the &#39;grease monkey&#39; look for something more like a super suit, still rocking with the pink.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Over all I like the new looks. I&#39;m excited to start reading and see what other visual changes may have happened to other heroes! :D</p>",
