      "id": 199660,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-28T16:32:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That's true, she left the team to go work at RevoCorp.</p><p>I like AZ's new outfit, more colorful and sans that silly triangle faceplate. &nbsp;Interesting that Unity adopted the same outfit in the RPG as in Tactics (although the belt buckle is different, of course). &nbsp;I like Tachyon's color scheme, but those goggles are ridiculous. &nbsp;Bunker is... interesting, \"Sentai\" is definitely a good word for it. &nbsp;Legacy and Wraith look about the same.</p><p>The other weird thing is the position of \"The Roleplaying Game\" speech bubble. &nbsp;It overlaps Legacy's head, so my first take on it was that he was the one saying those words, which broke the 4th wall. &nbsp;Of course, it's also weird that the letter S should be saying them.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
