      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>That&#39;s true, she left the team to go work at RevoCorp.</p><p>I like AZ&#39;s new outfit, more colorful and sans that silly triangle faceplate. &nbsp;Interesting that Unity adopted the same outfit in the RPG as in Tactics (although the belt buckle is different, of course). &nbsp;I like Tachyon&#39;s color scheme, but those goggles are ridiculous. &nbsp;Bunker is... interesting, &quot;Sentai&quot; is definitely a good word for it. &nbsp;Legacy and Wraith look about the same.</p><p>The other weird thing is the position of &quot;The Roleplaying Game&quot; speech bubble. &nbsp;It overlaps Legacy&#39;s head, so my first take on it was that he was the one saying those words, which broke the 4th wall. &nbsp;Of course, it&#39;s also weird that the letter S should be saying them.</p>",
