      "raw": "[quote=\"Phantom5613\"]\n And last but not least Unity has left behind the &#39;grease monkey&#39; look for something more like a super suit, still rocking with the pink.&nbsp;Over all I like the new looks. I&#39;m excited to start reading and see what other visual changes may have happened to other heroes! :D\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nGot to say, I like this outfit more than the Tactics one for unity, probably because the metal ribbing makes it look more like a suit of armor, but her original look is still the best. Possibly Termi-NAtion is better, but everytime I see her in a pink latex jumpsuit instead of clothing I just twinge a little inside. I like her as the type of person who heroes in their everyday street clothes, it just feels like that&#39;s what she would do\n",
